    "text": "DeepSeek LLM is a general-purpose language model series from DeepSeek, released as open weights in 7B and 67B sizes, each as a Base and a Chat model, under the DeepSeek Model License, which permits commercial use. DeepSeek says the models were trained from scratch on 2 trillion English and Chinese tokens; the model cards also link to DeepSeek's chat website.",
