  "notes": "Sizes 7B and 67B, each as Base and Chat, are inline variants of one release. Release day taken from the earliest repository commit (see dates.released.note); the arXiv report of 2024-01-05 is the first DeepSeek text with a stated date. The DeepSeek-V2 README labels the 67B model DeepSeek-V1 (Dense-67B); DeepSeek otherwise calls it DeepSeek LLM 67B or DeepSeek 67B. The 7B model uses multi-head attention, the 67B model grouped-query attention. Generation left empty: DeepSeek gives no generation number at release."
